{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcabbit is a swing-focused 2D action game where you switch between left and right hooks to latch onto walls and floors, building speed along arcs as you race through neon stages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: A grappling + swinging platformer powered by two hooks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volume: ~100 total challenges (each challenge = the section from one checkpoint to the next)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel: Short retries make repeated attempts easy, so you can steadily feel your improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound: An electronic soundtrack that syncs with stage effects and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visuals: High-contrast neon visuals make routes intuitive and easy to read</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three-Step Action</h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Hook: Fires toward the aiming direction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/68ab751acd57c1220efce7fa4ac0b599.poster.avif?t=1764582027\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/68ab751acd57c1220efce7fa4ac0b599.webm?t=1764582027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/68ab751acd57c1220efce7fa4ac0b599.mp4?t=1764582027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Connect: Locks to a wall or floor on hit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910660/extras/c62af189a0808345051e0f938fbb21af.poster.avif?t=1764582027\" width=1280 